## @param density Density parameter of the generated gradient.
## @param inner Inner gradient color.
## @param outer Outer gradient color.
## @return An owning image, or null if acquisition fails. Release with unload_image.
func gen_image_gradient_radial(width: i32, height: i32, density: f32, inner: native.color, outer: native.color) -> image?:
    var value = native.gen_image_gradient_radial(width, height, density, inner, outer)
    return _wrap_image(value)

## Generate image: square gradient.
## @param width Width in pixels.
## @param height Height in pixels.
